      "content": "You should frame the audit not as a success, but as a demonstration of their *current* operational ceiling. Emphasize that while their defenses are \"solid,\" they are static, and the threat landscape is evolving faster than their current protocols can handle. Position the Advanced Continuous Monitoring package as the necessary proactive layer that turns their strong foundation into an impenetrable fortress against future, unseen risks. This shifts the conversation from cost to essential, forward-looking defense.",
